The `next-best-practices`, `next-cache-components` and `next-upgrade` skills in this
plugin are adapted from the Next.js agent skills written by Vercel, as published in:

- vercel-labs/next-skills (https://github.com/vercel-labs/next-skills)
  That repository carries no license file. Its README says the skills moved to
  vercel/next.js (https://github.com/vercel/next.js/tree/canary/skills), which is
  MIT licensed:
  Copyright (c) 2025 Vercel, Inc.

The adapted text matches the files in vercel-labs/next-skills before the move.
The skills now in vercel/next.js are different documents, so the notice above
credits the author and the new home and is not a claim that the MIT grant there
covers the adapted text.

